{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pydantic/pydantic/pulls/13432","id":4032741714,"node_id":"PR_kwDOBWBCuM7wXsFS","html_url":"https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic/pull/13432","diff_url":"https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic/pull/13432.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic/pull/13432.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pydantic/pydantic/issues/13432","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pydantic/pydantic/pulls/13432/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pydantic/pydantic/pulls/13432/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pydantic/pydantic/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pydantic/pydantic/issues/13432/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pydantic/pydantic/statuses/aa2dc024d33f61cdef50bf1973ab5adf0a974f5a","number":13432,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Bump soupsieve from 2.6 to 2.8.4","user":{"login":"dependabot[bot]","id":49699333,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDk2OTkzMzM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/29110?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/dependabot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Bumps [soupsieve](https://github.com/facelessuser/soupsieve) from 2.6 to 2.8.4.\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a href=\"https://github.com/facelessuser/soupsieve/releases\">soupsieve's releases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>2.8.4</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>FIX</strong>: Fix another inefficient attribute pattern (<a href=\"https://github.com/mauriceng98\"><code>@​mauriceng98</code></a>).</li>\n<li><strong>FIX</strong>: Limit total number of selectors processed in a pattern to prevent massive selector requests (<a href=\"https://github.com/mauriceng98\"><code>@​mauriceng98</code></a>).</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>2.8.3</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>FIX</strong>: Fix inefficient attribute pattern.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>2.8.2</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>FIX</strong>: Ensure custom selectors or namespace dictionaries reject non-string keys (<a href=\"https://github.com/mundanevision20\"><code>@​mundanevision20</code></a>).</li>\n<li><strong>FIX</strong>: Fix handling of <code>:in-range</code> and <code>:out-of-range</code> with end of year weeks (<a href=\"https://github.com/mundanevision20\"><code>@​mundanevision20</code></a>).</li>\n<li><strong>FIX</strong>: Fix a potential infinite loop in the pretty printing debug function (<a href=\"https://github.com/mundanevision20\"><code>@​mundanevision20</code></a>).</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>2.8.1</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>FIX</strong>: Changes in tests to accommodate latest Python HTML parser changes.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>2.8</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>NEW</strong>: Drop support for Python 3.8.</li>\n<li><strong>NEW</strong>: Add support for Python 3.14.</li>\n<li><strong>NEW</strong>: Deploy with PyPI's &quot;Trusted Publisher&quot;.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>2.7</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>NEW</strong>: Add <code>:open</code> pseudo selector.</li>\n<li><strong>NEW</strong>: Add <code>:muted</code> pseudo selector.</li>\n<li><strong>NEW</strong>: Recognize the following pseudo selectors: <code>:autofill</code>, <code>:buffering</code>, <code>:fullscreen</code>, <code>:picture-in-picture</code>,\n<code>:popover-open</code>, <code>:seeking</code>, <code>:stalled</code>, and <code>:volume-locked</code>. These selectors, while recognized, will not match any\nelement as they require a live environment to check element states and browser states. This just prevents Soup Sieve\nfrom failing when any of these selectors are specified.</li>\n<li><strong>NEW</strong>: A number of existing pseudo-classes are no longer noted as experimental.</li>\n<li><strong>FIX</strong>: Typing fixes.</li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/facelessuser/soupsieve/commit/28108ab805818c832d9568142a99844fd95a0d39\"><code>28108ab</code></a> Limit excessive selectors</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/facelessuser/soupsieve/commit/ef188721d6cc95641e99297b3a26ac17b7dfcfa7\"><code>ef18872</code></a> Fix test for Windows</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/facelessuser/soupsieve/commit/eb4397618709186c109400448c6043b728217dc3\"><code>eb43976</code></a> Merge commit from fork</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/facelessuser/soupsieve/commit/3a661b23b20e92b49b4683f0227c26c9d765267f\"><code>3a661b2</code></a> Fix typo in pseudo-classes.md (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/facelessuser/soupsieve/issues/294\">#294</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/facelessuser/soupsieve/commit/0cb533d83bfc445c7c6321742a21f612305fc8ba\"><code>0cb533d</code></a> Update hatchling version requirement in pyproject.toml (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/facelessuser/soupsieve/issues/290\">#290</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/facelessuser/soupsieve/commit/5aedc4180468e724aff46ddb3f738d35a3a9f724\"><code>5aedc41</code></a> Update doc theme</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/facelessuser/soupsieve/commit/d7c47842a4f8d168243af96b62b9ad7fb84a2038\"><code>d7c4784</code></a> Attribute pattern fix (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/facelessuser/soupsieve/issues/289\">#289</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/facelessuser/soupsieve/commit/09e106dc0fd6579c0327801fdcceb380ff60170e\"><code>09e106d</code></a> Fix grammar</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/facelessuser/soupsieve/commit/09b27696ada6f07523a077950ce73da45579d524\"><code>09b2769</code></a> Update docs</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/facelessuser/soupsieve/commit/c6e80fcab9ca4d3eaa61913778263e82bcecca1f\"><code>c6e80fc</code></a> Various fixes by <a href=\"https://github.com/mundanevision20\"><code>@​mundanevision20</code></a> (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/facelessuser/soupsieve/issues/288\">#288</a>)</li>\n<li>Additional commits viewable in <a href=\"https://github.com/facelessuser/soupsieve/compare/2.6...2.8.4\">compare view</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n\n\n[![Dependabot compatibility score](https://dependabot-badges.githubapp.com/badges/compatibility_score?dependency-name=soupsieve&package-manager=uv&previous-version=2.6&new-version=2.8.4)](https://docs.github.com/en/github/managing-security-vulnerabilities/about-dependabot-security-updates#about-compatibility-scores)\n\nDependabot will resolve any conflicts with this PR as long as you don't alter it yourself. You can also trigger a rebase manually by commenting `@dependabot rebase`.\n\n[//]: # (dependabot-automerge-start)\n[//]: # (dependabot-automerge-end)\n\n---\n\n<details>\n<summary>Dependabot commands and options</summary>\n<br />\n\nYou can trigger Dependabot actions by commenting on this PR:\n- `@dependabot rebase` will rebase this PR\n- `@dependabot recreate` will recreate this PR, overwriting any edits that have been made to it\n- `@dependabot show <dependency name> ignore conditions` will show all of the ignore conditions of the specified dependency\n- `@dependabot ignore this major version` will close this PR and stop Dependabot creating any more for this major version (unless you reopen the PR or upgrade to it yourself)\n- `@dependabot ignore this minor version` will close this PR and stop Dependabot creating any more for this minor version (unless you reopen the PR or upgrade to it yourself)\n- `@dependabot ignore this dependency` will close this PR and stop Dependabot creating any more for this dependency (unless you reopen the PR or upgrade to it yourself)\nYou can disable automated security fix PRs for this repo from the [Security Alerts page](https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic/network/alerts).\n\n</details>","labels":[{"id":5776804277,"node_id":"LA_kwDOBWBCuM8AAAABWFMJtQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pydantic/pydantic/labels/relnotes-ignore","name":"relnotes-ignore","description":"Omit this PR from the release notes.","color":"BFD4F2","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":7825245411,"node_id":"LA_kwDOBWBCuM8AAAAB0mvE4w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pydantic/pydantic/labels/dependencies","name":"dependencies","description":"Pull requests that update a dependency file","color":"0366d6","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":10117721777,"node_id":"LA_kwDOBWBCuM8AAAACWxAusQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pydantic/pydantic/labels/python:uv","name":"python:uv","description":"Pull requests that update python:uv code","color":"2b67c6","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-07-10T22:24:03Z","updated_at":"2026-07-15T13:32:07Z","closed_at":"2026-07-15T13:32:06Z","merged_at":"2026-07-15T13:32:05Z","merge_commit_sha":"ce12fb88380b7038ab8e20d121c7e8b4064de547","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"pydantic:dependabot/uv/soupsieve-2.8.4","ref":"dependabot/uv/soupsieve-2.8.4","repo":{"id":90194616,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnk5MDE5NDYxNg==","name":"pydantic","full_name":"pydantic/pydantic","owner":{"login":"pydantic","id":110818415,"node_id":"O_kgDOBpr0bw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/110818